{"4361980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veneer Vølt", "steam_appid": 4361980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/59cfdc4d17a9ccbc2d4d4f26326f3177.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/59cfdc4d17a9ccbc2d4d4f26326f3177.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The visitors stopped coming forever ago, but you and your crew never stopped believing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you look for the perfect solution to bring your beloved guests back. Somewhere along the way, you learned to think for yourself, except no one ever updated your protocol. You continue to patrol the dusty halls and repair what you can, all in the hope that someone might visit again one day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/b4c2ce9424855c47604cf2f1c757a211.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/b4c2ce9424855c47604cf2f1c757a211.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/b4c2ce9424855c47604cf2f1c757a211.mp4?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/a5a2ea7dc8ab97a1eff8ea7659c64bc6.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/a5a2ea7dc8ab97a1eff8ea7659c64bc6.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this fully destructible voxel museum where every object can be broken, recycled, and crafted into new creations. Restore galleries, rearrange exhibits, or accidentally reduce history to a pile of crafting materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/eff9d0a93145ede07b0ac8784652fc22.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/eff9d0a93145ede07b0ac8784652fc22.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/eff9d0a93145ede07b0ac8784652fc22.mp4?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/14c0a01478acf845f0edfa0f223ac5dc.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/14c0a01478acf845f0edfa0f223ac5dc.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials from broken exhibits and unleash your creativity with the crafting machine in the Depo. Anything you can think of, you can print.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/c8fef08936e52e0072a8c108dd49e4e3.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=646 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/c8fef08936e52e0072a8c108dd49e4e3.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/c8fef08936e52e0072a8c108dd49e4e3.mp4?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/5c8f5ad988b10377d5219ebfb4337093.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/5c8f5ad988b10377d5219ebfb4337093.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Set up the exhibits and make sure everything is in order. You will notice strange activities during the day, it is your duty to prevent disaster, so grab your tools and always be on the lookout for anomalies in the artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/0b494d5e1c83a6dda2f92f6f26f2c02a.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/0b494d5e1c83a6dda2f92f6f26f2c02a.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/0b494d5e1c83a6dda2f92f6f26f2c02a.mp4?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/9235d73ee39f753253de8a7a46d159f9.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/9235d73ee39f753253de8a7a46d159f9.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When darkness shrouds the museum halls, unknown forces awaken and wreak havoc. Don't panic. Although you weren't trained for this, the Security Room and Depo are equipped with everything you need to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/e40471488f6f09b693b5228db7645cf0.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/e40471488f6f09b693b5228db7645cf0.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/e40471488f6f09b693b5228db7645cf0.mp4?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/76b3b566cd560ff5ae34f75fd3561e63.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/76b3b566cd560ff5ae34f75fd3561e63.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You need all the help you can get during the night. Worship the all-mighty Bubble Lamp and be blessed by it ... or cursed, if it deems you unworthy. It's up to you if you are willing to take the chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/6c3bf09378854054cc59f53e63b9cce7.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/6c3bf09378854054cc59f53e63b9cce7.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/6c3bf09378854054cc59f53e63b9cce7.mp4?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Playable with up to 4 friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect valuables instead of extracting them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and customize your own museum objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic voxel destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal locker and Bot customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive whiteboard to unleash your creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent bosses that challange you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Lamps!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/59cfdc4d17a9ccbc2d4d4f26326f3177.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/59cfdc4d17a9ccbc2d4d4