kness shrouds the museum halls, unknown forces awaken and wreak havoc. Don't panic. Although you weren't trained for this, the Security Room and Depo are equipped with everything you need to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/e40471488f6f09b693b5228db7645cf0.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/e40471488f6f09b693b5228db7645cf0.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/e40471488f6f09b693b5228db7645cf0.mp4?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/76b3b566cd560ff5ae34f75fd3561e63.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/76b3b566cd560ff5ae34f75fd3561e63.webm?t=1787058147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You need all the help you can get during the night. Worship the all-mighty Bubble Lamp and be blessed by it ... or cursed, if it deems you unworthy. It's up to you if you are willing to take the chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/6c3bf09378854054cc59f53e63b9cce7.poster.avif?t=1787058147\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4361980/extras/6c3b